<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24776" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-vĭŏlātus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Unhurt</i>, <i>inviolate</i>
			(class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">invulnerati inviolatique,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Sest. 67, 140</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpus omnium civium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rab. Perd. 4, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amicitia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Sull. 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vita,</span>”
				i. e. <i>happy</i>, <i>pleasant</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					13, 875</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terra,</span>”
				i. e. <i>unploughed</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 1, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquid integrum atque inviolatum praestare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Cael. 5, 11</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Inviolable</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tribuni plebis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 3,
					55</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tribunicia potestas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					54</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">templum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
				1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pudicitia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. Liv. Aug. 43</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fides publica,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sall. J. 33, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jus vel fas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just.
					8, 3, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fama,</span>”
				<i>unavailable</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sall. J. 43, 1</span></i>
			.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">invĭŏlātē</span></b> , <i>inviolably</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">servare memoriam alicujus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Sen. 22, 81 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">servare jusjurandum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					7, 18, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
